# The commit of slaclab/beamtimehero_cli this repo installs. requirements.txt
# installs exactly this commit (non-editable) into ./venv. MANUALLY ADVANCED:
# write the new full sha here AND in requirements.txt, then
# `venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt` and `venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -q`.
